### Fix #4 — Unique Index di Database 🟡 Penting → ✅ Fixed
**File:** `database/migrations/2026_08_04_000001_add_unique_index_evidence_number_transaction_type.php`

**Masalah:** Kolom `journal_headers.evidence_number` tidak memiliki unique constraint. Semua proteksi anti-dobel murni logika aplikasi, rawan lolos saat race condition/retry.

**Fix:** 
- Migration otomatis cleanup duplikat existing (keep oldest, delete rest + journal_details)
- Tambah unique index `uq_journal_evidence_type` pada `(evidence_number, transaction_type)`
- Graceful fallback jika index gagal dibuat (tidak break migration)

