### Verification Command — Deteksi Double-Posting yang Sudah Terjadi
**File:** `app/Console/Commands/CheckDuplicateJournals.php`

**Command:** `php artisan journal:check-duplicates`

Menjalankan query verifikasi:
```sql
SELECT evidence_number, transaction_type, COUNT(*) AS jumlah_jurnal
FROM journal_headers
GROUP BY evidence_number, transaction_type
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;
```

Menampilkan detail setiap duplikat (journal_id, tanggal) dan total jurnal berlebih yang perlu dihapus.

